For $k=1$ to p Do:\\
\begin{equation*}
 {\phi _{k,1}}({X_k}) = E\left[ {\theta (Y) - \sum\limits_{i \ne k} {{\phi _i}\left( {{X_i}} \right)} \left| {{X_k}} \right.} \right];
\end{equation*}
replace $\phi_k(X_k)$ with $\phi_{k,1}(X_k)$;\\
End For Loop;

\begin{equation*}
{\theta _1}(Y) = {{E\left[ {\sum\limits_{i = 1} {{\phi _i}({X_i})\left| Y \right.} } \right]} \over {\left\| {E\left[ {\sum\limits_{i = 1}^p {{\phi _i}({X_i})\left| Y \right.} } \right]} \right\|}};
\end{equation*}
replace $\theta(Y)$ with $\theta_1(Y)$;
